message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Lonely runner conjecture: dense windows and the covering framework, an obstruction catalogue, a perturbation bound, a reduction, and eight runners"
abstract: >-
  Six manuscripts on the lonely runner conjecture (dense velocity windows, obstructions to certificate-based
  proofs, perturbations of the tight instance, a reduction to a single crux, a covering framework, and eight
  runners), with the Lean 4 sources they cite, and the programs and certificates that regenerate their finite
  computations. Statements carry the labels given in each manuscript; several results are finite
  computations that are not formalized.
